' Tour slide 9 — "What paths can execution take?"
' Activity diagram over the SAME course-registration territory. Plan §S s9.
' The BRANCH is the content: one capacity decision, two paths, one rejoin.
' Every action is one short line, so the figure stays near 1.6:1 and projects large.
@startuml
!include _theme.puml
skinparam nodesep 100
skinparam ranksep 55

start
:Request a section;
:Check capacity;
if (seats available?) then ([yes])
  :Create enrollment;
else ([no])
  :Add to waitlist;
endif
:Notify student;
stop
@enduml
